    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is a bit disappointing, so don\u2019t expect much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a shame, but it's the first simple puzzle arcade game I've developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may be a bit difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing repeatedly, you can earn coins and upgrade your players to make the game a little easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take the challenge!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 tutorial levels and 6 challenging levels await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solve various puzzles and gimmicks. Test your senses</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need some control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Don't be afraid of failure.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can try again at any time. Even developers who may have played more games than anyone else have experienced many failures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be honest, I don't have any expectations, but if I get a certain amount of sales, I'm thinking of slowing down the development of the new game and adding playable levels and various elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>If you would like to give your opinion, please join Discord</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is a bit disappointing, so don\u2019t expect much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a shame, but it's the first simple puzzle arcade game I've developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may be a bit difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing repeatedly, you can earn coins and upgrade your players to make the game a little easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take the challenge!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 tutorial levels and 6 challenging levels await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solve various puzzles and gimmicks. Test your senses</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need some control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Don't be afraid of failure.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can try again at any time. Even developers who may have played more games than anyone else have experienced many failures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be honest, I don't have any expectations, but if I get a certain amount of sales, I'm thinking of slowing down the development of the new game and adding playable levels and various elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>If you would like to give your opinion, please join Discord</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
